+            missing.len() * 2 < keys.len(),
+            "more than half of the {} new S4 keys were never observed across {} files — \
+             likely a wiring bug, not corpus rarity: {:?}",
+            keys.len(),
+            scanned,
+            missing
+        );
+    }
